{
  "text": "Level one is the fastest human on Earth. But by Level seven, man-made machines are moving at four hundred thousand miles per hour. And Level ten literally breaks the laws of physics. This is the ultimate speed comparison. From a sprint on the track to the cosmic speed limit of the universe. Fasten your seatbelts. The countdown starts RIGHT NOW! Level one: Usain Bolt. Twenty-seven point eight miles per hour! The undisputed king of human biology! If you tried to sprint next to him, you would be left eating dust in two seconds! Level two: The Cheetah. Seventy miles per hour! Zero to sixty faster than a Ferrari! Pure muscle and evolutionary engineering! Level three: The Peregrine Falcon. Two hundred forty miles per hour! Diving from the clouds at terminal velocity! That is four times faster than any cheetah on Earth! Level four: Bugatti Chiron Super Sport. Three hundred four miles per hour! Sixteen cylinders, four turbochargers! The fastest production road car in human history! Level five: The SR-71 Blackbird. Two thousand one hundred ninety-three miles per hour! Mach three point three! The air friction is so hot the titanium skin literally expands mid-flight! Missiles cannot catch this jet because it simply outruns them! Level six: Apollo 10. Twenty-four thousand seven hundred ninety-one miles per hour! Mach thirty-two! That is the fastest speed any human crew has ever traveled! They crossed from the Moon back to Earth in a blaze of plasma! Level seven: NASA Parker Solar Probe. Four hundred thirty thousand miles per hour! Falling straight toward the Sun! At this speed, you could fly from New York to Tokyo in under a minute! Level eight: CERN Large Hadron Collider Protons. Six hundred seventy million miles per hour! Ninety-nine point nine nine nine nine nine nine one percent the speed of light! Millions of superconducting magnets pushing particles so fast that time itself begins to slow down! Level nine: The Speed of Light in a Vacuum. Six hundred seventy million six hundred sixteen thousand miles per hour! Three hundred thousand kilometers every single second! In the time it takes you to blink, a beam of light circles the entire Earth seven point five times! And now... Level ten. The impossible apex. Cosmic Inflation and Quantum Entanglement. During the Big Bang, the fabric of spacetime itself expanded faster than light. And when two quantum particles are entangled, they communicate instantaneously across billions of light years! Zero delay. Infinite speed. The universe's ultimate cheat code. The debate is over. The champion has been crowned. And the numbers have settled it. Which speed level blew your mind the most? Drop your vote in the comments below, hit subscribe to join The Comparison Arena, and tell us which extreme showdown we should run next!",
